<title>UK: BOE allots 424 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 424 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 424 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 220 million stg in bills outright and 204 million stg in repos to April 28 and 29.</p>
</text>
